   "source": "The air seems to freeze around the blade of this sword, draining all heat from the area.\nIt is said the Conclave created this weapon for their warmaster during the dark times of the first allure war.",
   "target": "这把剑的剑锋周围空气似乎都冻结了，吸走了这片区域的所有热量。\n据说孔克雷夫在第一次诱惑战争的黑暗时期，为他们的战争领主打造了这件武器。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/general/objects/boss-artifacts-maj-eyal.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
